endency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"明确有限证明的地址深度与归纳高度差一"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\">\\(\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)\">\\(\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)\\)</span>；所有投影在这个五元对象上取值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 遍历同一演算的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(\\rho)\">\\(h(\\rho)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"eaf2215780d904d4\" href=\"?note=eaf2215780d904d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-height\">72-df-proof-height</a> 的孩子秩，有限证明叶秩为0。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"d(\\pi):=\\operatorname{depth}(\\pi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[d(\\pi):=\\operatorname{depth}(\\pi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}\\quad d(\\rho)=h(\\rho)+1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}\\quad d(\\rho)=h(\\rho)+1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留与实际统一depth的兼容名称。</p>\n<p>有限树上归纳：叶的地址深度为1、秩为0；接到新根时两边都按孩子最大值加一。对无穷良基树，地址长度上确界与递归秩可以不同，因此新增等式只量化有限Proof，不推广到WFProof。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-derivation-length","status":"resolved","id":"0712d19732fa81e7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-derivation-length]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-height","status":"resolved","id":"eaf2215780d904d4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-height]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle$ 及 $\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle$ 满足 [[72-df-proof-tree]] 的 $\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)$；所有投影在这个五元对象上取值。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-height","status":"resolved","id":"eaf2215780d904d4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\rho$ 遍历同一演算的 $\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}$；$h(\\rho)$ 取 [[72-df-proof-height]] 的孩子秩，有限证明叶秩为0。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}","display":